6. BOOKING PROCESS & SLOT CONFIRMATION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
How time slots are reserved and managed in BlitzApp:

* Instant Reservation & Slot Locks:
  Selecting an open time slot and confirming the booking creates an active 
  reservation. The time slot is locked atomically in the database to prevent 
  duplicate or conflicting bookings.

* First-Come, First-Served:
  Slots are allocated on a strictly first-come, first-served basis. If two users 
  attempt to reserve the same slot simultaneously, database transactions ensure 
  that only the first confirmed request succeeds.

* Manager Slot Blocking:
  Venue managers may block specific slots for private maintenance or local club 
  events using their management dashboard, provided they do not override existing 
  confirmed customer bookings.


7. PAYMENT & FEE STRUCTURE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* Customer-to-Venue Payments:
  BlitzApp does NOT process digital credit card payments or hold customer 
  deposits. Customers pay the venue manager directly on-site at the sports 
  facility (typically in cash in IQD upon arrival) or through private 
  arrangements agreed between the customer and the venue operator.

* Platform Service Fee (Venue Managers):
  Registered venue operators are subject to an internal 3% platform commission 
  on completed customer reservations. Platform fees are calculated by the system 
  and settled periodically between the venue manager and platform administration.

* Price Guarantees:
  Venue managers may not demand higher prices than the rate displayed in the 
  application at the time the customer confirmed the reservation.


